          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "7. The village playground is shaped as a square of side 40 metres. A path of width s metres is created around the playground for people to walk. Find an expression for the area of the path in terms of s."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.188,
            0.824,
            0.224
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "8. If a number plus its reciprocal equals "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 0 } { 3 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , find the number."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.226,
            0.885,
            0.285
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "9. A rectangular pool has area "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 x ^ { 2 } + 7 x + 3"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " square hastas. If its width is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "2 x + 1"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " hastas, find its length. Hasta was a unit used to measure length."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.29,
            0.874,
            0.33
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "*10. If both "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x - 2"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x - { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " are factors of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "p x ^ { 2 } + 5 x + r ,"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , show that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "p _ { \\leq } r"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.336,
            0.74,
            0.376
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "*11. If "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a+b+c=5"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " and ab "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "+bc+ca=10"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " , then prove that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "a^{3}+b^{3}+c^{3}-3abc=-25."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.383,
            0.884,
            0.424
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "*12. By factoring the expression, check that "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "n ^ { 3 } - n"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is always divisible by 6 for all natural numbers n. Give reasons."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.43,
            0.376,
            0.451
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "*13. Find the value of"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.187,
            0.455,
            0.602,
            0.476
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(i) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x^{3}+y^{3}-12xy+64,\\mathrm{when}\\ x+y=-4"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.478,
            0.622,
            0.5
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(ii) "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "x^{3}-8y^{3}-36xy-216,\\mathrm{when}\\ x=2y+6"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.374,
            0.525,
